{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos The Devil is a Ps1 era inspired 3D platformer. Run, jump and fly your way through a new adventure, done the old way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Times' up, death comes to all. But what comes after? Emerge from your coffin and seek the ultimate answers, but all may not be as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >19 Diverse levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple level play styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wacky deaths</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Done the old way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos The Devil pays tribute to the old classics. This isn't a modern take, this is a full lean into retro 3D platformer design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/937739e48bd5afea7f289dd29d817526.poster.avif?t=1757141941\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/937739e48bd5afea7f289dd29d817526.webm?t=1757141941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/937739e48bd5afea7f289dd29d817526.mp4?t=1757141941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple level styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin, jump and smash your way through a variety of level styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/ea7599fb1f379aa40015f4186bbd0768.poster.avif?t=1757141941\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/ea7599fb1f379aa40015f4186bbd0768.webm?t=1757141941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/ea7599fb1f379aa40015f4186bbd0768.mp4?t=1757141941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flee from bosses, fly across lava fields and navigate on runaway trains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/37aa5fc7da163067211aaca924f312de.poster.avif?t=1757141941\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/37aa5fc7da163067211aaca924f312de.webm?t=1757141941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/37aa5fc7da163067211aaca924f312de.mp4?t=1757141941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live the story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the gems, buy your way through the underworld and uncover secrets along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/dffc6db2178c9e7471a877d8e2c5b9a9.poster.avif?t=1757141941\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/dffc6db2178c9e7471a877d8e2c5b9a9.webm?t=1757141941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849330/extras/dffc6d